I don't think the exact semantics of zo'e filling are defined in all cases.
That is, I don't think the language defines {mi tavla gi'e citka vau} as {mi
tavla gi'e citka vau vau} or as {mi tavla gi'e citka vau zo'e vau}, but
rather whichever one fits the context (in this case, almost certainly the
former).

mu'o mi'e .latros.

